{"audio": "john-15.opus", "duration_ms": 210172, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2040, "end_ms": 3500, "text": "John, Chapter Fifteen."}, {"start_ms": 4720, "end_ms": 8480, "text": "“I am the true vine, and My Father is the keeper of the vineyard."}, {"start_ms": 9181, "end_ms": 16961, "text": "He cuts off every branch in Me that bears no fruit, and every branch that does bear fruit, He prunes to make it even more fruitful."}, {"start_ms": 17821, "end_ms": 21201, "text": "You are already clean because of the word I have spoken to you."}, {"start_ms": 21841, "end_ms": 24181, "text": "Remain in Me, and I will remain in you."}, {"start_ms": 25041, "end_ms": 32562, "text": "Just as no branch can bear fruit by itself unless it remains in the vine, neither can you bear fruit unless you remain in Me."}, {"start_ms": 33762, "end_ms": 36002, "text": "I am the vine and you are the branches."}, {"start_ms": 36482, "end_ms": 40102, "text": "The one who remains in Me, and I in him, will bear much fruit."}, {"start_ms": 40842, "end_ms": 42962, "text": "For apart from Me you can do nothing."}, {"start_ms": 43903, "end_ms": 49063, "text": "If anyone does not remain in Me, he is like a branch that is thrown away and withers."}, {"start_ms": 49843, "end_ms": 53783, "text": "Such branches are gathered up, thrown into the fire, and burned."}, {"start_ms": 54483, "end_ms": 60183, "text": "If you remain in Me and My words remain in you, ask whatever you wish, and it will be done for you."}, {"start_ms": 61003, "end_ms": 66824, "text": "This is to My Father’s glory, that you bear much fruit, proving yourselves to be My disciples."}, {"start_ms": 67944, "end_ms": 70904, "text": "As the Father has loved Me, so have I loved you."}, {"start_ms": 71644, "end_ms": 72804, "text": "Remain in My love."}, {"start_ms": 73604, "end_ms": 80765, "text": "If you keep My commandments, you will remain in My love, just as I have kept My Father’s commandments and remain in His love."}, {"start_ms": 81525, "end_ms": 86625, "text": "I have told you these things so that My joy may be in you and your joy may be complete."}, {"start_ms": 87765, "end_ms": 91725, "text": "This is My commandment, that you love one another as I have loved you."}, {"start_ms": 92605, "end_ms": 97046, "text": "Greater love has no one than this, that he lay down his life for his friends."}, {"start_ms": 98166, "end_ms": 101026, "text": "You are My friends if you do what I command you."}, {"start_ms": 101726, "end_ms": 107006, "text": "No longer do I call you servants, for a servant does not understand what his master is doing."}, {"start_ms": 107566, "end_ms": 113066, "text": "But I have called you friends, because everything I have learned from My Father I have made known to you."}, {"start_ms": 114067, "end_ms": 116627, "text": "You did not choose Me, but I chose you."}, {"start_ms": 117247, "end_ms": 125267, "text": "And I appointed you to go and bear fruit—fruit that will remain—so that whatever you ask the Father in My name, He will give you."}, {"start_ms": 126047, "end_ms": 129107, "text": "This is My command to you: Love one another."}, {"start_ms": 130267, "end_ms": 133988, "text": "If the world hates you, understand that it hated Me first."}, {"start_ms": 134788, "end_ms": 137968, "text": "If you were of the world, it would love you as its own."}, {"start_ms": 138828, "end_ms": 144768, "text": "Instead, the world hates you, because you are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world."}, {"start_ms": 145828, "end_ms": 158429, "text": "Remember the word that I spoke to you: ‘No servant is greater than his master.’ If they persecuted Me, they will persecute you as well; if they kept My word, they will keep yours as well."}, {"start_ms": 159029, "end_ms": 164349, "text": "But they will treat you like this because of My name, since they do not know the One who sent Me."}, {"start_ms": 165289, "end_ms": 169190, "text": "If I had not come and spoken to them, they would not be guilty of sin."}, {"start_ms": 170070, "end_ms": 172770, "text": "Now, however, they have no excuse for their sin."}, {"start_ms": 173730, "end_ms": 176670, "text": "Whoever hates Me hates My Father as well."}, {"start_ms": 177630, "end_ms": 187031, "text": "If I had not done among them the works that no one else did, they would not be guilty of sin; but now they have seen and hated both Me and My Father."}, {"start_ms": 187911, "end_ms": 202952, "text": "But this is to fulfill what is written in their Law: ‘They hated Me without reason.’ When the Advocate comes, whom I will send to you from the Father—the Spirit of truth who proceeds from the Father—He will testify about Me."}, {"start_ms": 203732, "end_ms": 207972, "text": "And you also must testify, because you have been with Me from the beginning."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 2040, "e": 2340, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2620, "e": 2940, "si": 0}, {"t": "Fifteen.", "s": 3020, "e": 3500, "si": 0}, {"t": "“I", "s": 4720, "e": 4740, "si": 1}, {"t": "am", "s": 4920, "e": 5020, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5080, "e": 5160, "si": 1}, {"t": "true", "s": 5260, "e": 5480, "si": 1}, {"t": "vine,", "s": 5500, "e": 5920, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6120, "e": 6220, "si": 1}, {"t": "My", "s": 6280, "e": 6440, "si": 1}, {"t": "Father", "s": 6520, "e": 6880, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 7040, "e": 7180, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7260, "e": 7360, "si": 1}, {"t": "keeper", "s": 7440, "e": 7780, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7840, "e": 7900, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7960, "e": 8020, "si": 1}, {"t": "vineyard.", "s": 8060, "e": 8480, "si": 1}, {"t": "He", "s": 9181, "e": 9241, "si": 2}, {"t": "cuts", "s": 9341, "e": 9621, "si": 2}, {"t": "off", "s": 9701, "e": 9881, "si": 2}, {"t": "every", "s": 10081, "e": 10321, "si": 2}, {"t": "branch", "s": 10441, "e": 10761, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 10801, "e": 10901, "si": 2}, {"t": "Me", "s": 10941, "e": 11021, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 11121, "e": 11261, "si": 2}, {"t": "bears", "s": 11